# Negative SHACL fixture: a CameraView (a Frame, neither Entity nor Composition)
# bears vso:hasQuality. MUST fail vss:HasQualityShape.
#
# Regression guard: before the sh:or(Entity, Composition) fix, the shape used
# `sh:class vso:QualityBearer` — vacuous under inference="rdfs", because
# QualityBearer is hasQuality's rdfs:domain, so rdfs entailment typed every
# hasQuality subject into QualityBearer and the shape could never fire. This
# scene wrongly conformed back then.

@prefix vso: <https://vson.dev/v1/ontology#> .
@prefix :    <https://example.org/scenes/bad_qb#> .

:cam a vso:CameraView ;
     vso:hasQuality :q .   # ← CameraView is a Frame, not a QualityBearer.

:q a vso:Quality ;
   vso:dimension vso:Color ;
   vso:value "blue" .
